    {
      "url": "https://www.holmwoods.eu/",
      "title": "Holmwood's | Learning English for Life | Individuals and Schools",
      "text": "LOGIN\n \nHome\n \nOur courses\n \nNews\n \nAbout us\n \nContact\nLEARN ENGLISH WITH HOLMWOODS!\n\n\nHolmwoods’ language courses are used by schools and individuals who are serious about achieving outstanding results. Designed by teachers and language experts, our courses provide an essential combination of fun but effective language lessons and exercises. \n\nWhich Course?\n\nHolmwoods has a course for each age group. For the youngest primary school children, we have Kids. Tweens is for primary school pupils in the upper levels and Tracks for secondary school and college students.  \n\nWhether your organization has 100,000 students or you want to study alone, we have a course for you. \n\nKids\nTweens\nTracks\nPersonal Use\n\nReal Life\n\nVloggers from English speaking countries share their lives with students.\n\n\nEffective\n\nStudents use the English they have learned in fun projects and assignments.\n\n\nAdaptive\n\nHolmwoods’ courses adapt and respond to students’ results.\n\n\nMotivational\n\nStudents earn points and medals encouraging healthy competition.\n\nMeet our local learning experts\nNederland\nColombia\nEspaña\n \n© Holmwoods Educational 2023 | Privacy policy",
